1
00:00:00,091 --> 00:00:01,849
Everything that follows comes from the

2
00:00:01,862 --> 00:00:04,531
record — police and NSG timelines, court

3
00:00:04,544 --> 00:00:07,148
testimony, and the recordings themselves.

4
00:00:07,552 --> 00:00:09,440
And the record says this story doesn't

5
00:00:09,453 --> 00:00:11,393
start on November 26th.

6
00:00:12,634 --> 00:00:14,418
It starts five days earlier.

7
00:00:15,607 --> 00:00:17,430
On the night of November 21st,

8
00:00:17,938 --> 00:00:20,503
ten men slipped out of Karachi aboard two

9
00:00:20,516 --> 00:00:21,454
cargo vessels,

10
00:00:22,052 --> 00:00:24,058
the Al Fauz and the Al Hussaini.

11
00:00:24,474 --> 00:00:26,727
For roughly thirty-eight hours, the Indian

12
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:28,003
Navy never saw them.

13
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:31,206
Each man carried an AK-47 and eight

14
00:00:31,219 --> 00:00:31,883
grenades.

15
00:00:32,259 --> 00:00:34,264
And dried fruit, for the journey.

16
00:00:35,459 --> 00:00:36,748
On November 23rd,

17
00:00:37,347 --> 00:00:38,975
at around 4:30 PM,

18
00:00:39,561 --> 00:00:41,566
they seized an Indian fishing trawler,

19
00:00:42,061 --> 00:00:43,311
the MV Kuber.

20
00:00:43,701 --> 00:00:45,303
They killed four of its crew.

21
00:00:45,707 --> 00:00:47,738
The captain, they kept alive — to sail

22
00:00:47,751 --> 00:00:48,636
them to India.

23
00:00:49,928 --> 00:00:51,933
Within sight of Mumbai, they killed him

24
00:00:51,946 --> 00:00:52,337
too.

25
00:00:52,741 --> 00:00:55,045
No one was left who could warn anyone.

26
00:00:56,231 --> 00:00:58,627
Except the warnings already existed.

27
00:00:59,044 --> 00:01:01,127
Indian intelligence had intercepted a

28
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:03,822
satellite call on November 18th about a

29
00:01:03,835 --> 00:01:04,929
sea-borne attack.

30
00:01:05,305 --> 00:01:08,052
US intelligence had warned the Taj Hotels

31
00:01:08,065 --> 00:01:11,281
chairman, Ratan Tata, months before.

32
00:01:12,546 --> 00:01:13,366
Two warnings.

33
00:01:13,757 --> 00:01:15,932
Neither one changed what was waiting on

34
00:01:15,945 --> 00:01:16,544
the shore.

